					Is.
					7.3
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ προβαλόμενος</span>
			<i>one who has brought evidence,</i> Lex ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				46.10
			</span></i>; <i>cite as an example,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθνος οὐδὲν ἔχομεν προβαλέσθαι
